# 🌟 VibeMatch - Fashion Recommendation System

A modern, AI-powered fashion recommendation platform built with the MERN stack. VibeMatch creates personalized outfit bundles (Dress + Ornament + Cosmetic) based on user style preferences, using inclusive terminology and logic-based matching algorithms.

![VibeMatch](https://img.shields.io/badge/MERN-Stack-brightgreen)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-blue)

## ✨ Features

### 🎯 Core Features
- **Smart Vibe Matching**: Logic-based algorithm matches complete looks based on user preferences
- **Interactive Style Quiz**: 5-step onboarding to capture user preferences
- **Virtual Preview**: CSS-based layering system for outfit visualization
- **Dynamic Theming**: CSS variables change based on selected vibe
- **Color Affinity Tracking**: Learns user color preferences over time
- **Razorpay Integration**: Secure payment processing (test mode)
- **Admin Dashboard**: Analytics with charts (Recharts)

### 🌈 Inclusive Design
- Uses **Undertone** (Warm/Cool/Neutral) instead of "Skin Color"
- Uses **Preferred Silhouette** instead of "Body Type"
- Uses **Seasonal Palette** for color matching
- Jewelry tone preference to infer undertone

### 🎨 Modern UI/UX
- **Future Dusk** (#2E2E5E) navbar theme
- Glassmorphism effects
- Smooth animations (Framer Motion)
- Gradient backgrounds
- Responsive design
- Dark theme optimized

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Backend
- **Node.js** + **Express** - Server
- **MongoDB** + **Mongoose** - Database
- **JWT** - Authentication
- **Razorpay** - Payments
- **Bcrypt** - Password hashing

### Frontend
- **React 18** - UI Framework
- **Vite** - Build tool (faster than CRA)
- **Tailwind CSS** - Styling
- **Framer Motion** - Animations
- **Zustand** - State management
- **React Router v6** - Navigation
- **Recharts** - Analytics charts
- **Axios** - HTTP client

